# Source material, not part of the website.
# Both are irreplaceable — keep them backed up outside git.
# "Red Rose.pages"  : the original 134 MB Pages document the posts came from.
# source-photos/    : the full-resolution originals. The web-ready versions in
#                     public/visits/ are committed, so the site builds without
#                     these; they are only needed to re-run `pnpm prepare-images`.
Red Rose.pages
